      "notes": "CRITICAL: fixes OTA patches landing in _internal/ while the exe served from root/ — installs now mirror _internal to root on every startup (auto-heals any patch since 2.0.2 that looked installed but never displayed). Also: OTA no longer blocks _internal/app.py from extraction, every bundle carries a _notare_version.txt stamp with rollback if it mismatches the manifest, cumulative with 2.0.4 hardening and all prior fixes."
    },
